{"articleNo":"2635","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2635&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010학년도 하계방학 산업체 인턴십 지원 내역 알림","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.10.13","hit":"12346","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><!--StartFragment--></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">2010학년도 하계 방학 산업체 인턴십 지원비 지급 안내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">- 지급일자 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">: 2010. 10. 13(수)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">- 지급금액</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"> : 1인당 286,800원(세금 공제 후)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 81.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -81.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 81.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -81.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">- 지급기준</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"> : 고학년자 우선, 같은 학년에서는 전체 총 평점평균이 높은자 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">지원</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">&nbsp;(4학년이상이 우선 지원되었으며, 3학년은 평점평균이 높은자가 지원되었음)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">- 기타 문의사항은 478-7029(교무연구과)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;478-7359(테크노관행정실) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;478-7751(디지털관행정실)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;478-7598(글로벌관행정실)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
